This version starts Sketch at zero. One click returns a replacement with 5 minutes and keeps the name.

after:
```react
const initialPlan = { name: "Survey", minutes: 10 };
function extend(plan) {
  return { ...plan, minutes: plan.minutes + 5 };
}
function App() {
  const [plan, setPlan] = React.useState(initialPlan);
  return (
    <main>
      <p role="status">{plan.name}: {plan.minutes} minutes</p>
      <button onClick={() => setPlan(current => extend(current))}>
        Add five
      </button>
    </main>
  );
}
```
One click shows `Survey: 15 minutes`. Another shows `20`. `initialPlan.minutes` stays `10`.
